d-atlas/kansas/rawlins-county"],["ARC or PLC in Rawlins County","/arc-plc/kansas/rawlins-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids in Rawlins County came in under 90% of normal in November to December in 41 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle ran 54% of normal in March to April and 206% of normal in August to September. In 2026 the middle has February to March at 12% of normal. Grid 23816 had its driest year in 2002 at 49% of normal.</p>"}
